# Data Validation & Quality Checks

This folder contains validation results for the datasets used in the Logistics Operations & Fleet Performance Analytics project.

The validation checks were performed to assess data completeness, uniqueness, consistency, date ranges, missing identifiers, and other data-quality issues before interpreting the analytical results.

## Purpose

These checks help establish confidence in the analysis and identify limitations that should be considered when interpreting the dashboards and recommendations.

## Scope

Validation covered the relevant datasets used in the project, including loads, trips, delivery events, fuel purchases, maintenance records, truck utilisation, drivers, trucks, trailers, routes, facilities, and customers.

The results also informed the project's data-quality assessment and limitations documented in the project report.

